    "UIName": "Bushwacker BSW-QSK",
    "Id": "mechdef_bushwacker_BSW-QSK",
    "Name": "Bushwacker BSW-QSK",
    "Details": "Quicksell knows pilots like fire, and is happy to provide. The BSW-QSK brings two of Quicksell's newest plasma-based weaponry, the Plasma Scattergun - guaranteed to melt any opposition, to the field. Targets still standing in that sea of flame? We've included a light mortar and REX Laser to help clean up anything remaining. Our classic Viewmaster Cockpit provides the widest field of view, ensuring pilots will become entranced by the wonders of the <size=200%><color=#ff0000>F</color><color=#ff8000>L</color><color=#ffff00>A</color><color=#ff8000>M</color><color=#ff0000>E</color><size=100%>.<size=80%> Please do not use <size=100%>Quicksell<size=80%> equipment to found any sort of group that may result in stern letters being written to us. Yes - that includes an 'Extreme' S'mores Making Club.<size=50%> Please send us any s'mores though.<size=100%> \n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Narrow/Low Profile</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.05</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Lower, Right Lower</color>",
    "Icon": "bushwacker"
  },
